ADDENDA <Presidential Decree No. 14409, Nov. 3, 1994>
(1) (Enforcement date) This Decree shall enter into force on the date of its promulgation.
(2) (Transitional measures concerning designation of managers of erosion control facilities) Forestry fraternity designated as the managers of erosion control facilities under the previous regulations as at the time this Decree enters into force shall be deemed the managers of erosion control facilities designated under the provisions of Article 12.
(3) (Transitional measures concerning beneficiaries of revenue upon rescission of designation of erosion control land) The erosion control facility manager entitled to the profits from the relevant erosion control land upon the rescission of the designation of an erosion control land managed by the forestry fraternity under paragraph (2) at the time of the enforcement of this Decree, shall be the relevant forestry fraternity, notwithstanding the proviso of Article 18(1).

